# Skills: Meta

Purpose:
  Meta-skills for the SDDRA system. These skills manage other skills —
  discovery, recommendation, gap analysis, and integration.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @SKILL-DISCOVERY.sdd
   3  @SKILL-RECOMMENDATION.sdd
   4  @SKILL-GAP-ANALYSIS.sdd
   5  @SKILL-EXTERNAL-REFERENCES.sdd

Rules:
  [M1] Meta-skills analyze, do not execute domain logic.
  [M2] Recommendations require >= 80% relevance.
  [M3] Gap analysis must be run before new feature development.
  [M4] Skill additions require human approval.

Navigation:
  SkillDiscovery: @SKILL-DISCOVERY.sdd
  SkillRecommendation: @SKILL-RECOMMENDATION.sdd
  SkillGapAnalysis: @SKILL-GAP-ANALYSIS.sdd

State: +
